        "title": "依据 + basis",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "依据 introduces evidence or a rule used in reaching a judgment. It marks reasoning from a basis, rather than simple sequence.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我们依据规定判断。",
                "pinyin": "wǒmen yījù guīdìng pànduàn 。",
                "meaning": "We make judgments based on the regulations.",
                "audio": "810efb210ed675f82d84cb6260eb4aec62ffc3ffed7447bead468ecd2107760c"
              },
              {
                "text": "请依据规定办理。",
                "pinyin": "qǐng yījù guīdìng bànlǐ 。",
                "meaning": "Please handle it according to the regulations.",
                "audio": "8208aa7be45b32bd99cd5640c39809f4b920c151d95882677896dd725928c62a"
